        <item>
            <title>3.16.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 15:44:02 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>197</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.16.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 3.16.0</h2><ul></ul><p><strong>New</strong></p><ul><li>Sort files into nested folders with your own rules, such as year and month.</li><li>Sort files after renaming them, without using another rename credit.</li></ul><p><strong>Improved</strong></p><ul><li>More responsive batch renaming and folder monitoring.</li><li>Better grouping of music albums with different track artists.</li><li>Undo now restores the original name and folder after sorting.</li></ul>
]]></description>
